##LEMO FM was honored to be featured as the App Store EDITOR'S CHOICE of the Week!

LEMO FM is a minimal, elegant white noise app that lets you focus, relax or fall asleep fast by playing high-definition nature sounds. Under the concept of "Less is more", we designed LEMO FM. Its interface is in the shape of a simple and beautiful radio. When you touch the button of the radio with your finger, the natural sound starts to play, and the breathing light also start to flash one breath at a time, these well-designed interactions allow you to start a journey of sound in the most ceremonial way.

##WHAT YOU CAN DO WITH LEMO FM:

- Relax – calm your mind and enter a state of comfort, relaxation and security;
- Focus – helps you focus longer and work efficiently
- Learning - can eliminate external interference, and be more immersed and focused when learning
- Sleep - the sounds of nature can help you quickly fall into a deep sleep state

##FUTURE FUNCTION PLANNING:

- More beautiful radio interface themes;
- Richer high-quality natural sounds;
- Support iOS 16 lock screen widget;
- Supports access to Apple Watch;
- Support access to music content such as Apple Music;
- Adapt the display effect on the large screen for the iPad;
- Support for mixing: you can create your own audio through mixing;

